<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{{VIEW_NAME}}</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 2rem auto;">
    <p>Write the email content here — this is a normal .spinx.html
    template, so @if/@foreach/&#123;&#123; &#125;&#125; all work exactly
    like any other view. @island is technically available too, but most
    email clients strip <script> tags and won't hydrate JS — stick to
    plain HTML/inline CSS for anything that has to render reliably
    across clients.</p>
</body>
</html>
